<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Alarm &amp; Timer</key>
	<string>闹钟与计时器</string>
	<key>Appearance</key>
	<string>外观</string>
	<key>Background</key>
	<string>背景</string>
	<key>By default the pill is dark and slightly see-through. The background color is used with the Color style.</key>
	<string>默认情况下，胶囊采用略微透明的深色背景。选择“自定义颜色”样式后，将使用所设置的背景颜色。</string>
	<key>City</key>
	<string>城市</string>
	<key>Color</key>
	<string>自定义颜色</string>
	<key>Current Location</key>
	<string>当前位置</string>
	<key>Default</key>
	<string>默认</string>
	<key>Enabled</key>
	<string>启用</string>
	<key>Glint turns the status bar clock into its pill. Long press it to pick what it shows. Tap it to open its card; pills without a card go to the next pill when Tap to Cycle is on.</key>
	<string>Glint 将状态栏时钟变为胶囊。长按可选择显示内容，轻点可打开对应卡片；对于没有卡片的胶囊，启用“轻点切换”后，轻点可切换到下一个胶囊。</string>
	<key>Leave empty to use an already-authorized location; otherwise enter a city. Open-Meteo receives the approximate coordinates (about 1 km) of the location or city.</key>
	<string>留空时仅使用已获授权的位置；未授权时请填写城市。Open-Meteo 会接收当前位置或所填城市的大致坐标（约 1 公里精度）。</string>
	<key>Notification Display Time</key>
	<string>通知显示时长</string>
	<key>Notifications</key>
	<string>通知</string>
	<key>Now Playing</key>
	<string>正在播放</string>
	<key>Pill</key>
	<string>胶囊</string>
	<key>Quick Message</key>
	<string>快捷信息</string>
	<key>Replace Banners</key>
	<string>替换通知横幅</string>
	<key>Replace Volume Indicator</key>
	<string>替换音量指示器</string>
	<key>Show Music While Playing</key>
	<string>播放时显示音乐</string>
	<key>Show Seconds</key>
	<string>显示秒数</string>
