	<string>以紧凑的音量胶囊替代系统音量指示器。</string>
	<key>Shows the app of a new notification in the pill instead of a banner. Tap the pill to read it, tap the card to open the app. Notifications still go to Notification Center.</key>
	<string>收到新通知时，在胶囊中显示来源应用，而不显示横幅。轻点胶囊可阅读通知，轻点卡片可打开应用。通知仍会保留在通知中心。</string>
